<title>UK: Rheinhypo sets 1.0 bln mark March 2001 Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Rheinhypo sets 1.0 bln mark March 2001 Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Bayerische Hypothekenbank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25 PCT  MATURITY    22.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.665    PAY DATE   S22.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  22.5 BP   REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  12.5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
